!internal_thought.md

# Credentials must never be baked into the image.
#
# `COPY . .` will happily ship a service-account key into the image, and if
# express.static is rooted at the app directory it becomes downloadable over
# the public internet. Two locks: excluded here, and server.js refuses to
# serve these paths.
google-service-account.json
*service-account*.json
service-account*.json
google-credentials*.json
credentials.json
secrets/
.secrets/
*.pem
*.key

# Operator notes and CI config: not runtime files.
backlog/
.gitea/
refs/
